    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like resilience to me. it just feels wrong. like i'm just a placeholder. everyone else has moved on or is trying to move on, but i'm just... existing. i feel like i'm just occupying a spot that was meant for them. i'm a burden to everyone because i carry this all the time.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
